            {
              "id": "text-block-0",
              "type": "TextBlock",
              "props": {
                "text": "If agents can take real actions with side effects, guardrails stop being a nice-to-have. They become the price of admission.\\n\\n• Prompts are suggestions, not controls.\\n• Guardrails are enforceable boundaries.\\n• Start with a threat model: assets, entry points, trust boundaries, and controls.",
