          "id": "prompt_ceiling",
          "label": "prompt_ceiling",
          "startSec": 69.6,
          "endSec": 92.35000000000001,
          "text": "Prompts matter. They shape behavior and reduce error rates. But prompts are suggestions, not controls. When an agent has access to powerful tools, you eventually hit a ceiling. You can make failure less likely, but you can't make it vanish. Production safety can't be built out of suggestions alone. You need enforceable boundaries.",
